<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets 30.29 pct interest payment on OFZ bond.</title>
<headline>Russia sets 30.29 pct interest payment on OFZ bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry set a quarterly interest rate of 30.29 percent to be paid on July 23 on the two-year series 24009 OFZ interest-bearing government bonds maturing October 1998, the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		    3rd coupon		2nd coupon</p>
<p> pct rate	  30.29		     31.44</p>
<p> rouble terms    75,518		    78,385</p>
<p> payment date    July 23		   April 23</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
